:eul.
.*
.* From "Example: Parameter List" in the reference.
:PARML.
:PT.TERM
:PD.This is a description of
the term. :PK.Term:EPK. is
a programming keyword.
:PT.:PK def.DEFAULT:EPK.
:PD.This is a sample default
parameter.
:PT.:PV.variable:EPV.
:PD.This is a parameter variable.
:EPARML.
